{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"2c6f2c6885c0d90704c9582e6fe7720be42b3b4d3b820007897ccb662d08a6fa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣超越摩西"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["同蒙天召的圣洁弟兄啊，你们应当思想我们所认为使者、为大祭司的耶稣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他为那设立他的尽忠，如同摩西在 神的全家尽忠一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他比摩西算是更配多得荣耀，好像建造房屋的比房屋更尊荣；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为房屋都必有人建造，但建造万物的就是 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["摩西为仆人，在 神的全家诚然尽忠，为要证明将来必传说的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但基督为儿子，治理 神的家；我们若将可夸的盼望和胆量坚持到底，便是他的家了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["神子民的安息"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["圣灵有话说：",{"text":"你们今日若听他的话，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就不可硬着心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在旷野惹他发怒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"试探他的时候一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那里，你们的祖宗试我探我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且观看我的作为有四十年之久。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我厌烦那世代的人，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们心里常常迷糊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竟不晓得我的作为！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就在怒中起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们断不可进入我的安息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["弟兄们，你们要谨慎，免得你们中间或有人存着不信的恶心，把永生 神离弃了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["总要趁着还有今日，天天彼此相劝，免得你们中间有人被罪迷惑，心里就刚硬了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我们若将起初确实的信心坚持到底，就在基督里有分了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["经上说：「你们今日若听他的话，就不可硬着心，像惹他发怒的日子一样。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["那时，听见他话惹他发怒的是谁呢？岂不是跟着摩西从埃及出来的众人吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["神四十年之久，又厌烦谁呢？岂不是那些犯罪、尸首倒在旷野的人吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["又向谁起誓，不容他们进入他的安息呢？岂不是向那些不信从的人吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["这样看来，他们不能进入安息是因为不信的缘故了。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}